GET /api/v1/bills/records?month=2026-03&platform=deepseek&page=1
GET /api/v1/bills/by-model?month=2026-03
```

**前端组件**


- `DonutChart`：模型占比
- `GroupedList`：按 `date` 分组 FlatList

